```
CHUNK 1: Infrastructure + Tunnel
   │
   ├──► CHUNK 2: Network Monitor (runs on server)
   │
   ├──► CHUNK 3: Chrome Extension (runs on candidate browser)
   │
   ├──► CHUNK 4: Process Agent (runs on candidate machine)
   │
   ├──► CHUNK 5: Webcam Pipeline (runs on candidate machine)
   │
   └──► CHUNK 6: Anomaly Engine + Dashboard (all chunks feed into this)
```

> Chunks 2–5 can be built in parallel after Chunk 1.  
> Chunk 6 integrates everything, so it goes last.

